# Classic Synchronous Cycle

This project uses a simplified synchronous Wishbone cycle.

The clock provides the timing reference.

A simplified transaction can be represented as:

Clock    ─┐_┌─┐_┌─┐_┌─┐_┌─

CYC      ────────┐───────
                 └───────

STB      ────────┐───────
                 └───────

WE       ────────┐───────
                 └───────

ACK      ─────────────┐───
                      └───

The exact waveform depends on the implementation.

The important concept is that the transaction is synchronized to the clock and the Slave uses "ACK" to indicate completion.

---

# Project Architecture

The project uses the following architecture:

                 ┌──────────────────┐
                 │     Testbench    │
                 │ Wishbone Master  │
                 └────────┬─────────┘
                          │
                          │ Wishbone
                          ▼
                 ┌──────────────────┐
                 │ Wishbone Slave   │
                 │      RAM         │
                 └──────────────────┘

The testbench acts as the Master.

The RAM acts as the Slave.

